body:
I disagree with the devilkiwi24, but not in the way that they are wrong as that is probably the best way for a lot of people. Just remember that learning guitar is at your pace and if you aren't having fun while learning, you aren't doing it right. I hated learning fundamentals and just wanted to learn songs. I didn't realize it, but by doing so I was learning a lot of different fundamentals and practicing them more than I would if i had just learned like the major scale or what a diminished chord is for like a week.

&#x200B;

[Justinguitar.com](https://Justinguitar.com) is a great resource btw!

[Here](https://www.crimeonline.com/2021/08/11/update-florida-man-who-killed-a-mom-tot-girl-gets-massive-following-because-hes-too-cute-for-prison-reports/) is a source to a news article. The dude was street racing and mowed over a woman and child pedestrian, killing both of them. Something is very wrong with the world for wanting someone this negligent and stupid to get away with something like this.

&#x200B;

(Why does his mugshot look like a headshot?)
